/S /H2
/P 313 0 R
/T (The Low-Latency and Efficient Voice Activator for Edge Devices is a voice-based activation system designed to detect a predefined wake word or voice command locally on an edge device. Unlike conventional voice assistants that depend heavily on cloud servers, the proposed system performs the initial voice detection and processing directly on the device.)
/E (The Low-Latency and Efficient Voice Activator for Edge Devices is a voice-based activation system designed to detect a predefined wake word or voice command locally on an edge device. Unlike conventional voice assistants that depend heavily on cloud servers, the proposed system performs the initial voice detection and processing directly on the device.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
