/E ( The increasing use of smart devices, automation systems, and artificial intelligence has created a growing need for fast, reliable, and efficient voice-controlled technologies. Voice activation allows users to control electronic devices through spoken commands, reducing the need for physical switches and manual operation. However, many traditional voice recognition systems depend on cloud servers, which require internet connectivity and may introduce delays during communication and processing.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
