/P 317 0 R
/E (The main motivation behind the Low Latency and Efficient Voice Activator for Edge Devices project is to overcome these limitations by performing voice detection directly on edge hardware. By using a microcontroller such as the ESP32 or ESP32-S3, the system can process predefined voice commands locally, reduce response time, and minimize dependence on external servers. Local processing also improves privacy by reducing the need to transmit audio data over the internet.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
498 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
