/E (The scope of the Low Latency and Efficient Voice Activator for Edge Devices project is to design and develop a compact, cost-effective, and energy-efficient voice activation system using edge computing technology. The system uses a microcontroller such as the ESP32-S3 to process voice inputs and detect predefined commands locally, reducing dependence on cloud- based processing and continuous internet connectivity.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
